<title>INDIA: Yield on India 91-day t-bill down at 6.69 pct.</title>
<headline>Yield on India 91-day t-bill down at 6.69 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's central bank set the cut-off rate  at 98.36 rupees at its 91-day treasury bill auction on Friday.</p>
<p>Dealers said the yield had fallen to 6.69 percent from 6.73 percent  the previous week.  </p>
